{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-66711","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-97221","text":"Graphonomous MCP — Agent Skills"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-66713","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-97222","marks":["bold"],"text":"Purpose:"},{"id":"spn-97223","text":" Teach any LLM connected to Graphonomous how to use its MCP machines correctly, idiomatically, and in the right sequence. These reference docs mirror the skills in the "},{"id":"spn-97224","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"https://github.com/c-u-l8er/ampersand-plugins"}],"text":"ampersand-plugins"},{"id":"spn-97225","text":" Claude Code plugin. For Claude Code users, install the plugin directly: "},{"id":"spn-97226","marks":["code"],"text":"claude plugin add c-u-l8er/ampersand-plugins"}]}],"id":"blk-66712","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-66714","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-97227","text":"Quick Orientation"}]},{"id":"blk-66715","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-97228","text":"Graphonomous is a "},{"id":"spn-97229","marks":["bold"],"text":"continual learning engine"},{"id":"spn-97230","text":" exposed as 5 MCP machines. It maintains a "},{"id":"spn-97231","marks":["bold"],"text":"self-evolving knowledge graph"},{"id":"spn-97232","text":" of semantic, procedural, episodic, temporal, outcome, and goal nodes connected by typed, weighted edges. Your job as an LLM agent is to "},{"id":"spn-97233","marks":["bold"],"text":"read from and write to this graph"},{"id":"spn-97234","text":" as you work, creating a durable memory that improves over time."}]},{"id":"blk-66716","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-97235","text":"The Core Loop"}]},{"id":"blk-66717","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-97236","text":"Every interaction should follow this rhythm:"}]},{"id":"blk-66718","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"retrieve → route → act → learn → consolidate\n\"What do I know?\" → \"What should I do?\" → \"Do it\" → \"Did it work?\" → \"Clean up\""},{"id":"blk-66719","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-97237","text":"Machine Architecture (v0.4)"}]},{"id":"blk-66720","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-97238","text":"Graphonomous v0.4 exposes "},{"id":"spn-97239","marks":["bold"],"text":"5 loop-phase machines"},{"id":"spn-97240","text":" instead of 29 individual tools. Each machine accepts an "},{"id":"spn-97241","marks":["code"],"text":"action"},{"id":"spn-97242","text":" parameter:"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-66722","spans":[{"id":"spn-97243","text":"Machine"}]},{"id":"blk-66723","spans":[{"id":"spn-97244","text":"Phase"}]},{"id":"blk-66724","spans":[{"id":"spn-97245","text":"Actions"}]}],"id":"blk-66721","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-66725","spans":[{"id":"spn-97246","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve"}]},{"id":"blk-66726","spans":[{"id":"spn-97247","text":"\"What do I know?\""}]},{"id":"blk-66727","spans":[{"id":"spn-97248","text":"context, episodic, procedural, coverage, trace_evidence, frontier"}]}],[{"id":"blk-66728","spans":[{"id":"spn-97249","marks":["code"],"text":"route"}]},{"id":"blk-66729","spans":[{"id":"spn-97250","text":"\"What should I do?\""}]},{"id":"blk-66730","spans":[{"id":"spn-97251","text":"topology, deliberate, attention_survey, attention_cycle, review_goal"}]}],[{"id":"blk-66731","spans":[{"id":"spn-97252","marks":["code"],"text":"act"}]},{"id":"blk-66732","spans":[{"id":"spn-97253","text":"\"Do it\""}]},{"id":"blk-66733","spans":[{"id":"spn-97254","text":"store_node, store_edge, delete_node, manage_edge, manage_goal, belief_revise, forget_node, forget_policy, gdpr_erase"}]}],[{"id":"blk-66734","spans":[{"id":"spn-97255","marks":["code"],"text":"learn"}]},{"id":"blk-66735","spans":[{"id":"spn-97256","text":"\"Did it work?\""}]},{"id":"blk-66736","spans":[{"id":"spn-97257","text":"from_outcome, from_feedback, detect_novelty, from_interaction, contradictions"}]}],[{"id":"blk-66737","spans":[{"id":"spn-97258","marks":["code"],"text":"consolidate"}]},{"id":"blk-66738","spans":[{"id":"spn-97259","text":"\"Clean up\""}]},{"id":"blk-66739","spans":[{"id":"spn-97260","text":"run, stats, query, traverse"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-66740","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-97261","text":"Skill Reference Files"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-66742","spans":[{"id":"spn-97262","text":"File"}]},{"id":"blk-66743","spans":[{"id":"spn-97263","text":"Skill"}]},{"id":"blk-66744","spans":[{"id":"spn-97264","text":"What It Teaches"}]}],"id":"blk-66741","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-66745","spans":[{"id":"spn-97265","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/graphonomous/docs/skills/bootstrap.md"}],"text":"bootstrap.md"}]},{"id":"blk-66746","spans":[{"id":"spn-97266","marks":["code"],"text":"/graphonomous:bootstrap"}]},{"id":"blk-66747","spans":[{"id":"spn-97267","text":"Session initialization — retrieve context, check goals, survey attention"}]}],[{"id":"blk-66748","spans":[{"id":"spn-97268","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/graphonomous/docs/skills/retrieve.md"}],"text":"retrieve.md"}]},{"id":"blk-66749","spans":[{"id":"spn-97269","marks":["code"],"text":"/graphonomous:retrieve"}]},{"id":"blk-66750","spans":[{"id":"spn-97270","text":"The foundational read loop — κ-aware ranked retrieval + store new knowledge"}]}],[{"id":"blk-66751","spans":[{"id":"spn-97271","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/graphonomous/docs/skills/store.md"}],"text":"store.md"}]},{"id":"blk-66752","spans":[{"id":"spn-97272","marks":["code"],"text":"/graphonomous:store"}]},{"id":"blk-66753","spans":[{"id":"spn-97273","text":"Dedicated write path — atomic nodes, confidence calibration, edges"}]}],[{"id":"blk-66754","spans":[{"id":"spn-97274","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/graphonomous/docs/skills/learn.md"}],"text":"learn.md"}]},{"id":"blk-66755","spans":[{"id":"spn-97275","marks":["code"],"text":"/graphonomous:learn"}]},{"id":"blk-66756","spans":[{"id":"spn-97276","text":"Closed-loop learning — outcome, fee